# Shared by `mise run stow` and manual invocations: --no-folding is required
# because several packages write into the same target directories.
#
# Stow reads this file from cwd (or $HOME) only, so the mise stow tasks pin
# their dir to the repo root. A hand-typed stow from elsewhere skips it.
#
# No -d here: each bundle is its own stow directory, chosen per invocation
# (`mise run stow minimal`, or `stow -d stow/minimal shell` by hand).
#
# Ignore list (one copy instead of a .stow-local-ignore per package).
# Nested README/LICENSE need explicit patterns: stow's built-in list only
# matches those at the package root. Markdown is otherwise stowed on purpose:
# agent skills ship SKILL.md + references/*.md. A package's docs/ dir is not.
-t ~
--no-folding
--ignore=README\..*
--ignore=LICENSE
--ignore=Makefile
--ignore=\.DS_Store
--ignore=(^|/)docs(/|$)
